Relevant columns and their potential usage
• Symbol: may help double‑check that we are looking at the same instrument for both strategies.  
• StrikePrice: closing price of the CFD – will be one term of the intrinsic‑value calculation.  
• LastPx: opening / entry price of the CFD – the other term of the intrinsic‑value calculation.  
• Sides.Side: must equal 'LONG' to satisfy “long‑side trades”.  
• Sides.PartyIDs.PartyID: trader / strategy code – use this field to decide which rows belong to the momentum strategy (code contains ‘MOMO’) and which belong to the feeling‑lucky strategy (code contains ‘LUCK’).  
• TradeReportID (or OrderID): handy unique keys in case we need to de‑duplicate.  
• TradeDate / TransactTime: can be used to restrict dates, if necessary.

Typical conditions that are likely to be used  
1. UNNEST(Sides) AS s, UNNEST(s.PartyIDs) AS p  
2. WHERE s.Side = 'LONG'  
3. Momentum group:  LOWER(p.PartyID) LIKE '%momo%'  
4. Feeling‑lucky group:  LOWER(p.PartyID) LIKE '%luck%'  
5. Intrinsic value per trade:  (StrikePrice – LastPx) AS intrinsic_value  


Ten exploratory‑to‑final SQLs
```sql
-- 1) Description: Quick glance at the raw data.
SELECT * 
FROM `bigquery-public-data.cymbal_investments.trade_capture_report`
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2) Description: Distinct CFICode values to see instrument types.
SELECT DISTINCT `CFICode`
FROM `bigquery-public-data.cymbal_investments.trade_capture_report`
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3) Description: Distinct SenderCompID values – maybe strategy codes reside here.
SELECT DISTINCT `SenderCompID`
FROM `bigquery-public-data.cymbal_investments.trade_capture_report`
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4) Description: Pull all distinct PartyID values (after drilling‑down through the two nested arrays).
SELECT DISTINCT p.PartyID
FROM `bigquery-public-data.cymbal_investments.trade_capture_report`,
     UNNEST(Sides)  AS s,
     UNNEST(s.PartyIDs) AS p
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5) Description: Sample of PartyID, Side, StrikePrice, LastPx for visual inspection.
SELECT 
  p.PartyID,
  s.Side,
  t.StrikePrice,
  t.LastPx
FROM `bigquery-public-data.cymbal_investments.trade_capture_report` AS t,
     UNNEST(t.Sides)       AS s,
     UNNEST(s.PartyIDs)    AS p
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6) Description: Show LONG‑side trades whose PartyID looks like momentum (contains 'momo').
SELECT 
  t.TradeReportID,
  p.PartyID,
  (t.StrikePrice - t.LastPx) AS intrinsic_value
FROM `bigquery-public-data.cymbal_investments.trade_capture_report` AS t,
     UNNEST(t.Sides)    AS s,
     UNNEST(s.PartyIDs) AS p
WHERE LOWER(p.PartyID) LIKE '%momo%'
  AND s.Side = 'LONG'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7) Description: Show LONG‑side trades whose PartyID looks like feeling‑lucky (contains 'luck').
SELECT 
  t.TradeReportID,
  p.PartyID,
  (t.StrikePrice - t.LastPx) AS intrinsic_value
FROM `bigquery-public-data.cymbal_investments.trade_capture_report` AS t,
     UNNEST(t.Sides)    AS s,
     UNNEST(s.PartyIDs) AS p
WHERE LOWER(p.PartyID) LIKE '%luck%'
  AND s.Side = 'LONG'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8) Description: Compute the average intrinsic value for momentum strategy, LONG side.
SELECT 
  AVG(t.StrikePrice - t.LastPx) AS avg_intrinsic_momentum
FROM `bigquery-public-data.cymbal_investments.trade_capture_report` AS t,
     UNNEST(t.Sides)    AS s,
     UNNEST(s.PartyIDs) AS p
WHERE LOWER(p.PartyID) LIKE '%momo%'
  AND s.Side = 'LONG'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9) Description: Compute the average intrinsic value for feeling‑lucky strategy, LONG side.
SELECT 
  AVG(t.StrikePrice - t.LastPx) AS avg_intrinsic_feeling_lucky
FROM `bigquery-public-data.cymbal_investments.trade_capture_report` AS t,
     UNNEST(t.Sides)    AS s,
     UNNEST(s.PartyIDs) AS p
WHERE LOWER(p.PartyID) LIKE '%luck%'
  AND s.Side = 'LONG'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10) Description: Final answer – how much higher the feeling‑lucky average intrinsic value is than the momentum one (LONG side only).
SELECT 
  AVG(CASE WHEN LOWER(p.PartyID) LIKE '%luck%' THEN t.StrikePrice - t.LastPx END) 
      - 
  AVG(CASE WHEN LOWER(p.PartyID) LIKE '%momo%' THEN t.StrikePrice - t.LastPx END) 
    AS avg_intrinsic_difference_feelingLucky_minus_momentum
FROM `bigquery-public-data.cymbal_investments.trade_capture_report` AS t,
     UNNEST(t.Sides)    AS s,
     UNNEST(s.PartyIDs) AS p
WHERE s.Side = 'LONG'
LIMIT 20;
```

